          Apache-2.0; copy one of the four case files, change the numbers to your own, and
          run <code class={code}>examples/real_decision.py</code> with the people in the room.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6">
          <a href={DEMO_URL} class={btnPrimary}>Try it live</a>
          <a href={CASES_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class={btnGhost}>
            Open the case files
            <span
              class="inline-block transition-transform duration-200 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:translate-x-[3px]"
              aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span
            >
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-8 text-[13.5px] text-subtle">
          <a href="/" class={link}>Back to the overview</a> &middot;{" "}
          <a href="/llm-agent-red-lines/" class={link}>Next: what a red line is, exactly</a> &middot;{" "}
          <a href="/verify-ai-agent-decision/" class={link}>Then: verify the receipt afterwards</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </div>
